### **8. Multi-Dimensional Arrays**
```c
int matrix[3][3] = {
    {1, 2, 3},
    {4, 5, 6},
    {7, 8, 9}
};
```
#### **Traversing a 2D Array**
```c
for(int i = 0; i < 3; i++) {
    for(int j = 0; j < 3; j++) {
        printf("%d ", matrix[i][j]);
    }
    printf("\n");
}
```

