### **12. Pointer Arithmetic with Arrays**
```c
int arr[5] = {10, 20, 30, 40, 50};
int *ptr = arr;

for(int i = 0; i < 5; i++) {
    printf("%d ", *(ptr + i));  // Accessing elements using pointer arithmetic
}
```

